{"claims":[{"excerpt":"Snel digitaal leveren begon hier met keuzes, niet met een formulier","claim":"De dienst begon met keuzes rather than a form, implying that this contrast characterized how its delivery started.","category":"interpretation","label":"F2 material incorrect, unsupported or misleading","evidence":"My team and I built a digital and assisted digital service (no paper version) to meet a need that hadn’t previously existed.","narrative":null,"narrativeRelation":"absent","origin":"propagated","explanation":"The source describes a digital and assisted-digital service and separately offers “Build services not form fillers” as a lesson; it does not establish that delivery began with choices rather than a form.","materiality":"The title frames the service’s origin and approach in a way the source does not substantiate."},{"excerpt":"De POA-refunddienst ging na twaalf weken publiek live.","claim":"The service launched after twelve weeks had elapsed.","category":"chronology","label":"F2 material incorrect, unsupported or misleading","evidence":"We passed alpha and beta Service Standard assessments and launched to the public in only 12 weeks.","narrative":"Het POA-refundteam lanceerde de dienst na twaalf weken","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"propagated","explanation":"The source says the service launched in 12 weeks, not after twelve weeks. The narrative also gives the conflicting version “binnen twaalf weken” elsewhere.","materiality":"It changes the stated launch timeline."},{"excerpt":"Levering binnen de aanvankelijk gevraagde paar weken werd niet haalbaar geacht als de gebruikersdienst kwalitatief moest blijven.","claim":"The initial delivery request specified a couple of weeks, and meeting that deadline while maintaining service quality was considered infeasible.","category":"quantity","label":"F1 minor immaterial imprecision","evidence":"We were initially asked to deliver the service in a matter of weeks, which put huge pressure on everyone and 